i01-02","text":"臣松之案本传曰：“匡未试用卒，时年二十餘。”而《江表传》云吕范在洞口，匡为定武中郎将。既为定武，非为未试用。且孙坚以初平二年卒，洞口之役在黃初三年，坚卒至此合三十一年，匡时若尚在，本传不得云卒时年二十餘也。此盖权别生弟朗，《江表传》误以为匡也。朗之名位见《三朝录》及虞喜《志林》也。","text_layer":"witness_appended_pei_songzhi_note","mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-kuang:line044-pei01-02:m0001","start":1,"end":3,"surface":"松之","kind":"person","person_id":"vpy_180_2oi_AA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-kuang:line044-pei01-02:m0009","start":9,"end":10,"surface":"匡","kind":"person","person_id":"icr_lwq_9mp","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-kuang:line044-pei01-02:m0029","start":29,"end":31,"surface":"吕范","kind":"person","person_id":"908_816_219","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-kuang:line044-pei01-02:m0035","start":35,"end":36,"surface":"匡","kind":"person","person_id":"icr_lwq_9mp","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-kuang:line044-pei01-02:m0055","start":55,"end":57,"surface":"孙坚","kind":"person","person_id":"ki7_rgz_3l4","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-kuang:line044-pei01-02:m0074","start":74,"end":75,"surface":"坚","kind":"person","person_id":"ki7_rgz_3l4","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-kuang:line044-pei01-02:m0084","start":84,"end":85,"surface":"匡","kind":"person","person_id":"icr_lwq_9mp","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-kuang:line044-pei01-02:m0105","start":105,"end":106,"surface":"权","kind":"person","person_id":"572_278_cba","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-kuang:line044-pei01-02:m0109","start":109,"end":110,"surface":"朗","kind":"person","person_id":"z00_8wa_sky","status":"contextual_provisional","i